{"id":"213ce75a48289483","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-cohomology-realization.md","title":"Integral Cohomology Realization Data","display":"df-cohomology-realization — Integral Cohomology Realization Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cohomology-realization","aliases":["58-df-cohomology-realization"],"display":"df-cohomology-realization — Integral Cohomology Realization Data","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md]]","[[58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cohomology-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cohomology-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cohomology-realization — Integral Cohomology Realization Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03f2d34d9851bee4\" href=\"?note=03f2d34d9851bee4\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md\">../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" href=\"?note=fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" title=\"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md\">58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,D,D_X,D_Y,C,+,d,H,\\Theta,G,\\Psi,z\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,D,D_X,D_Y,C,+,d,H,\\Theta,G,\\Psi,z\\in V\\)</span>。长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle_r\">\\(\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle_r\\)</span> 使用定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的函数编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\langle C,+,d,H,\\Theta,G,\\Psi\\rangle_7\">\\(D=\\langle C,+,d,H,\\Theta,G,\\Psi\\rangle_7\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(j)\">\\(H(j)\\)</span> 是原给定上链复形的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个上同调载体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta(j)\">\\(\\Theta(j)\\)</span> 是到整数奇异上同调的指定加法同构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> 把有限支撑的分次族送到所给总上同调载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对满足该谓词的数据，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_D=D(3)\">\\(H_D=D(3)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_D=D(4)\">\\(\\Theta_D=D(4)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_D=D(5)\">\\(G_D=D(5)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi_D=D(6)\">\\(\\Psi_D=D(6)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_D(j)=\\Theta_D(j)^{-1}([\\mathbf0_{S_j(X,\\tau)}]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,j})\">\\(z_D(j)=\\Theta_D(j)^{-1}([\\mathbf0_{S_j(X,\\tau)}]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,j})\\)</span>。下述表示函数只在其断言规定的有效数据和次数域内使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bij}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Bij}(f,A,B)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in B^A\\land\\operatorname{ran}f=B\\land\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\;(f(a)=f(a&#39;)\\to a=a&#39;)\">\\(f\\in B^A\\land\\operatorname{ran}f=B\\land\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\;(f(a)=f(a&#39;)\\to a=a&#39;)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GradedCarrier}_S(H,z)\">\\(\\mathrm{GradedCarrier}_S(H,z)\\)</span> 的输入满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}H=\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}H=\\mathbb Z\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}z=\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}z=\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;z(j)\\in H(j)\">\\(\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;z(j)\\in H(j)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 均为集合编码的函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryCochain}_S(U,n,k,X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryCochain}_S(U,n,k,X,\\tau)\\)</span> 的输入满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leq k\\leq n&lt;\\omega\">\\(0\\leq k\\leq n&lt;\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in(C^2(X,\\tau))^n\">\\(U\\in(C^2(X,\\tau))^n\\)</span>。有限空积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、空和为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AffineFace}\">\\(\\mathrm{AffineFace}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntegralSingularCohomology}\">\\(\\mathrm{IntegralSingularCohomology}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyAddition}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyAddition}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyCup}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyCup}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" href=\"?note=fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" title=\"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md\">58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CochainComplex}\">\\(\\mathrm{CochainComplex}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cohomology}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cohomology}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}\">\\(\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"03f2d34d9851bee4\" href=\"?note=03f2d34d9851bee4\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md\">../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizedCohomologyScalar}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizedCohomologyScalar}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizedElementarySymmetricValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizedElementarySymmetricValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRealizedCohomologyValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRealizedCohomologyValue}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GradedCarrier}_S(H,z)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{a\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}H(j)\\right)^\\omega:\n(\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;a(j)\\in H(j))\\land|\\{j\\in\\omega:a(j)\\neq z(j)\\}|&lt;\\omega\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GradedCarrier}_S(H,z)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{a\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}H(j)\\right)^\\omega:\n(\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;a(j)\\in H(j))\\land|\\{j\\in\\omega:a(j)\\neq z(j)\\}|&lt;\\omega\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\exists C,+,d,H,\\Theta,G,\\Psi,z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nD=\\langle C,+,d,H,\\Theta,G,\\Psi\\rangle_7\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}\\Theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H(j),j;C,+,d)\n\\land\\operatorname{Bij}(\\Theta(j),H(j),\\mathrm{IntegralSingularCohomology}_S(X,\\tau,j))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in H(j)\\;\n\\Theta(j)(\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}_S(j;C,+,d)(\\langle a,b\\rangle))\n=\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyAddition}_S(X,\\tau,j)(\\langle\\Theta(j)(a),\\Theta(j)(b)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(z,\\omega,\\textstyle\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}H(j))\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(z(j)\\in H(j)\\land\\Theta(j)(z(j))=[\\mathbf0_{S_j(X,\\tau)}]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,j}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Bij}(\\Psi,\\mathrm{GradedCarrier}_S(H,z),G)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\exists C,+,d,H,\\Theta,G,\\Psi,z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nD=\\langle C,+,d,H,\\Theta,G,\\Psi\\rangle_7\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}\\Theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H(j),j;C,+,d)\n\\land\\operatorname{Bij}(\\Theta(j),H(j),\\mathrm{IntegralSingularCohomology}_S(X,\\tau,j))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in H(j)\\;\n\\Theta(j)(\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}_S(j;C,+,d)(\\langle a,b\\rangle))\n=\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyAddition}_S(X,\\tau,j)(\\langle\\Theta(j)(a),\\Theta(j)(b)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(z,\\omega,\\textstyle\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}H(j))\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(z(j)\\in H(j)\\land\\Theta(j)(z(j))=[\\mathbf0_{S_j(X,\\tau)}]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,j}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Bij}(\\Psi,\\mathrm{GradedCarrier}_S(H,z),G)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D_X,X,\\tau_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D_Y,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land j\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\\\\\n\\mathrm{RealizedCohomologyPullback}_S(f,D_X,D_Y,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,j)\\coloneqq\n\\Theta_{D_X}(j)^{-1}\\circ\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,j)\\circ\\Theta_{D_Y}(j).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D_X,X,\\tau_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D_Y,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land j\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\\\\\n\\mathrm{RealizedCohomologyPullback}_S(f,D_X,D_Y,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,j)\\coloneqq\n\\Theta_{D_X}(j)^{-1}\\circ\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,j)\\circ\\Theta_{D_Y}(j).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\land a,b\\in\\omega\\to\n\\mathrm{RealizedCohomologyCup}_S(D,X,\\tau,a,b)\\coloneqq\\\\\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle u,v\\rangle,\n\\Theta_D(a+b)^{-1}\\left(\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyCup}_S(X,\\tau,a,b)\n(\\langle\\Theta_D(a)(u),\\Theta_D(b)(v)\\rangle)\\right)\\right\\rangle:\nu\\in H_D(a)\\land v\\in H_D(b)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\land a,b\\in\\omega\\to\n\\mathrm{RealizedCohomologyCup}_S(D,X,\\tau,a,b)\\coloneqq\\\\\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle u,v\\rangle,\n\\Theta_D(a+b)^{-1}\\left(\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyCup}_S(X,\\tau,a,b)\n(\\langle\\Theta_D(a)(u),\\Theta_D(b)(v)\\rangle)\\right)\\right\\rangle:\nu\\in H_D(a)\\land v\\in H_D(b)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ElementaryCochain}_S(U,n,k,X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\Biggl\\{\\Biggl\\langle s,\n\\sum_{v\\in\\{v\\in n^k:\\forall i,j\\in k\\;(i&lt;j\\to v(i)&lt;v(j))\\}}\n\\prod_{j\\in k} U(v(j))\\!\\left(s\\circ\n\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(2k,\\{\\langle i,2j+i\\rangle:i\\in3\\})\\right)\n\\Biggr\\rangle:s\\in S_{2k}(X,\\tau)\\Biggr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ElementaryCochain}_S(U,n,k,X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\Biggl\\{\\Biggl\\langle s,\n\\sum_{v\\in\\{v\\in n^k:\\forall i,j\\in k\\;(i&lt;j\\to v(i)&lt;v(j))\\}}\n\\prod_{j\\in k} U(v(j))\\!\\left(s\\circ\n\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(2k,\\{\\langle i,2j+i\\rangle:i\\in3\\})\\right)\n\\Biggr\\rangle:s\\in S_{2k}(X,\\tau)\\Biggr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RealizedElementarySymmetricValue}_S(u,x,n,k,D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land k\\in n+1\n\\land x\\in H_D(2)^n\\land u\\in H_D(2k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists U\\in(C^2(X,\\tau))^n\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(U(i),X,\\tau,2)\n\\land[U(i)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,2}=\\Theta_D(2)(x(i)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Theta_D(2k)(u)=[\\mathrm{ElementaryCochain}_S(U,n,k,X,\\tau)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,2k}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RealizedElementarySymmetricValue}_S(u,x,n,k,D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land k\\in n+1\n\\land x\\in H_D(2)^n\\land u\\in H_D(2k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists U\\in(C^2(X,\\tau))^n\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{SingularCocycle}_S(U(i),X,\\tau,2)\n\\land[U(i)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,2}=\\Theta_D(2)(x(i)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Theta_D(2k)(u)=[\\mathrm{ElementaryCochain}_S(U,n,k,X,\\tau)]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,2k}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TotalRealizedCohomologyValue}_S(c,C,n,D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,n+1,\\textstyle\\bigcup_{k\\in n+1}H_D(2k))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in n+1\\;C(k)\\in H_D(2k)\n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{GradedCarrier}_S(H_D,z_D\\upharpoonright\\omega)\\;\\Bigl(\nc=\\Psi_D(a)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n(\\forall k\\in n+1\\;(j=2k\\to a(j)=C(k)))\n\\land(j\\notin\\{2k:k\\in n+1\\}\\to a(j)=z_D(j))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TotalRealizedCohomologyValue}_S(c,C,n,D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,n+1,\\textstyle\\bigcup_{k\\in n+1}H_D(2k))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in n+1\\;C(k)\\in H_D(2k)\n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{GradedCarrier}_S(H_D,z_D\\upharpoonright\\omega)\\;\\Bigl(\nc=\\Psi_D(a)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n(\\forall k\\in n+1\\;(j=2k\\to a(j)=C(k)))\n\\land(j\\notin\\{2k:k\\in n+1\\}\\to a(j)=z_D(j))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RealizedCohomologyScalar}_S(v,a,u,D,X,\\tau,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\land j\\in\\mathbb Z\\land a\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land u,v\\in H_D(j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists U\\in\\Theta_D(j)(u)\\;\n\\Theta_D(j)(v)=[\\{\\langle s,aU(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_j(X,\\tau)\\}]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,j}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RealizedCohomologyScalar}_S(v,a,u,D,X,\\tau,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\land j\\in\\mathbb Z\\land a\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land u,v\\in H_D(j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists U\\in\\Theta_D(j)(u)\\;\n\\Theta_D(j)(v)=[\\{\\langle s,aU(s)\\rangle:s\\in S_j(X,\\tau)\\}]^{\\mathrm c}_{X,\\tau,j}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原定理中固定的上同调对象可以采用任一已给定模型；本文件记录与整数奇异上同调的比较同构，而不把原有对象直接替换为另一个集合。</li>\n<li>所有拉回、杯积和零元均通过明确的比较函数搬运。分次总类使用指定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> 输出到原总载体，避免对属于不同次数群的元素直接作未定义的加法。</li>\n<li>取整数奇异上链及恒等比较函数可给出一组具体实现；定义本身不强制该选择。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]"